  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 16655749120
    m_Localized: So you are saying that all shrines are found.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 82439213056
    m_Localized: 'Good, I need to admit that you have been helpful for my studies. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86285389824
    m_Localized: 'Through thurough investigation I have also made some discoveries. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91238862848
    m_Localized: It seems that the shrines were a last ditch effort of an ancient
      people here in the caves to be able to preserve their magical findings for
      the future.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 102609620992
    m_Localized: The inscribings on the shrines say that they were running out of
      magic, but why I do not know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
